# [RevitUtilitiesService.cs](mdc:services/RevitUtilitiesService.cs) Quick Reference

## Purpose
Utility service for common Revit API operations with error handling and statistics collection.

## Key Features
1. **Creating Shared Parameters**
   ```csharp
   Guid guid = RevitUtilitiesService.Instance.CreateSharedParameter(
       app, doc, "ParamName", SpecTypeId.String.Text, "GroupName", 
       categoryId, isInstance: true);
   ```

2. **Reading Parameter Values**
   ```csharp
   string value = RevitUtilitiesService.Instance.GetParameterValue<string>(
       element, "ParameterName", defaultValue: "");
   
   // Handles type conversion automatically
   double number = RevitUtilitiesService.Instance.GetParameterValue<double>(
       element, "NumberParameter", defaultValue: 0.0);
   ```

3. **Setting Parameter Values**
   ```csharp
   // Auto-manages transactions if none provided
   RevitUtilitiesService.Instance.SetParameterValue(
       element, "ParameterName", "New Value");
       
   // Or use in existing transaction
   using (Transaction tx = new Transaction(doc, "Update Parameters"))
   {
       tx.Start();
       RevitUtilitiesService.Instance.SetParameterValue(
           element, "ParameterName", value, tx);
       tx.Commit();
   }
   ```

Remember: Call within valid Revit context using ExternalEvent pattern!
